<h1>Why Technology Is Necessary in Today’s World: Learn, Adapt, and Move Forward</h1>
<p class="article-intro">Technology is already shaping your world. The important question is not whether you know everything—it is whether you are willing to learn your next useful skill.</p>
<blockquote class="article-opening-quote">“You do not need to become an expert today. You only need the courage to begin.”</blockquote>
